&lt;h2 id="garden-description">Garden Description&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>This house was excavated in 1941. The &lt;em>atrium&lt;/em> led directly to a little &lt;em>viridarium&lt;/em> (a), with a cistern in the southwest corner. A gutter bordered the garden on the south, west and north sides.&lt;/p>
